        "deletions": [12, 13]
    },
    {
        "file_name": "src/main/File2.java",
        "insertions": [],
        "deletions": [20]
    }
]
```

### Common Mistake to Avoid

```json
...
  "insertions": [
      {
          "line_number": 42,
          "new_lines": ["foo"],
          "deletions": [43]  // ❌ This is invalid. "deletions" must not be inside an insertion.
